    {
      "id": "n_1km7x8g104",
      "type": "generic",
      "timestamp": null,
      "title": "Sermon notes",
      "content": "Talks about his puddle in church story. \n\nWhat's something that you have been avoiding / sidestepping (What's your puddle) \n\nJesus doesn't want to cover up your puddles he'll use them\n\n$ Jesus wants your puddles\n\n@1:27:03 in spite of all your sins God still wants to use you. \n\n$ God will use you in mysterious ways.\nHe wants you to flourish, he wants your puddles.\n\n@1:30:59\n\nYour not junk **your life matters** \n\n$$ Your puddles are beautiful",
      "tags": [
        "sermon-notes"
      ],
      "markers": [
        "rewatch-october-26"
      ],
      "visibility": "public",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-16T18:29:20Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-17T00:00:09Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_q6fx7g142n",
      "type": "timestamp",
      "timestamp": 5223.2,
      "title": "Isaiah 45:8",
      "content": "You heavens above, rain down my righteousness; let the clouds shower it down. Let the earth open wide, let salvation spring up, let righteousness flourish with it; I, the Lord, have created it.",
      "tags": [
        "verse"
      ],
      "markers": [],
      "visibility": "public",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-16T23:32:12Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T23:32:12Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_q623p71un5",
      "type": "timestamp",
      "timestamp": 5442.6,
      "title": "He wants the thing in your life that you think is ugly about you, so that he can use it for his almighty glory!",
      "content": "",
      "tags": [
        "one-liner"
      ],
      "markers": [],
      "visibility": "public",
