    },
    {
      "id": "n_2lxco8hq9w",
      "type": "timestamp",
      "timestamp": 5459.1,
      "title": "Isaiah 45:9",
      "content": "Wow to those who quarrel with their Maker, those are nothing but potsherds among the potsherds on the ground. Does the clay say to the potter, \"What are you making?\" Does your work say, \"The potter has no hands\"?",
      "tags": [
        "verse"
      ],
      "markers": [],
      "visibility": "public",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-16T23:39:46Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T23:41:39Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "n_1t03c5gl62",
      "type": "timestamp",
      "timestamp": 5565,
      "title": "When rain pounds the ground it saturates it, then things start to grow because of it and things begin to bloom. God is saturating your life with his glory.",
      "content": "",
      "tags": [
        "one-liner"
      ],
      "markers": [],
      "visibility": "public",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-16T23:46:29Z",
